    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 1 test run, 0 failures).\n\n## Summary\n\nI replaced the direct level computation with a points system.\n\n**`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a new read-only `membershipPoints` field (integer, min 0) and updated `membershipLevel` to range 1\u20134 with the new mapping description. The `OwnerDto` is generated from this spec, so both fields are now returned.\n\n**`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 replaced the old inline `membershipLevel` expression with two mappings backed by helper `default` methods:\n- `membershipPoints(owner)`: starts at 0, `+2` when an email is present, `+1` when `namesakeCount == 0`, `+2` when `householdSize >= 3`, `+3` when tenure (registration date to now) exceeds 365 days.\n- `membershipLevel(points)`: `1` for 0\u20131, `2` for 2\u20133, `3` for 4\u20135, `4` for 6+.\n\nThe acceptance test's scenario (email + no namesake, single-member household, zero tenure) scores `2 + 1 = 3` points \u2192 level `2`, matching the expected `membershipPoints=3`, `membershipLevel=2`.",
